@mathew_api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7006

### Get Shopping Lists for Family
GET {{mathew_api_HostAddress}}/ShoppingList/1
Accept: application/json

### Create Shopping List
POST {{mathew_api_HostAddress}}/ShoppingList
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekly Groceries",
  "familyId": 1
}

### Get Specific Shopping List
GET {{mathew_api_HostAddress}}/ShoppingList/list/1
Accept: application/json

### Add Item to Shopping List
POST {{mathew_api_HostAddress}}/ShoppingList/item
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Milk",
  "budgetAmount": 5.50,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "shoppingListId": 1
}

### Update Item
PUT {{mathew_api_HostAddress}}/ShoppingList/item
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Milk (2 Gallons)",
  "budgetAmount": 11.00,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "shoppingListId": 1,
  "done": false
}

### Purchase Item (Mark as Done and Create Expense)
POST {{mathew_api_HostAddress}}/ShoppingList/purchase/1?amount=10.50&registeredBy=Victor
Content-Type: application/json

